; Declarations (accounts and commodities) shared by every yearly book.
; Strict mode ('just check') rejects any account or commodity not declared here,
; so a typo in a rule or an uncategorised row (expenses:unknown,
; revenues:unknown) fails loudly instead of creating a new account.
; Account types are inherited by subaccounts.

; ==== Assets
account assets  ; type:A, money I own
account assets:bank-a:checking-bank-a  ; bank A checking account (main account)
account assets:bank-a:savings-1-bank-a  ; bank A savings account 1
account assets:bank-a:savings-2-bank-a  ; bank A savings account 2, no export (closed 2025-01-06)
account assets:bank-b:checking-bank-b  ; bank B checking account (used to send money to the investment account)
account assets:bank-b:investment-bank-b:CW8  ; bank B investment account, Amundi MSCI World Swap ETF (sold 2025-09-29)
account assets:bank-b:investment-bank-b:DCAM  ; bank B investment account, Amundi PEA Monde (MSCI World) ETF
account assets:bank-b:investment-bank-b:especes  ; bank B investment account, cash
account assets:broker-a:BTC  ; bitcoin held on broker A
account assets:broker-a:USDC  ; USDC held on broker A (bought as USDT, later converted for EU regulation compliance)
account assets:broker-a:especes  ; EUR cash on broker A
account assets:broker-b:BTC  ; bitcoin held on broker B
account assets:broker-b:especes  ; EUR cash on broker B
account assets:broker-c:BTC  ; bitcoin held on broker C
account assets:broker-c:especes  ; EUR cash on broker C
account assets:broker-d  ; life insurance (assurance vie) at broker D
account assets:in-transit  ; transfers between own accounts, while one side is booked and not the other
account assets:security-deposits  ; rental security deposits held by landlords
account assets:swile:meal-vouchers  ; Swile meal voucher balance

; ==== Liabilities
account liabilities  ; type:L, money I owe to others
account liabilities:student-loan  ; student loan

; ==== Equity
account equity  ; type:E, equal to A - L
account equity:opening-balances  ; balances before the books start (2024-01-01)
account equity:opening-closing-balances  ; yearly carry-forward between books (close --clopen); nets to 0 across years

; ==== Revenues
account revenues  ; type:R, revenues/income categories
account revenues:capital-gains:broker-d  ; broker D life insurance gain
account revenues:interest:savings-1-bank-a  ; savings 1 interest
account revenues:interest:savings-2-bank-a  ; savings 2 interest
account revenues:benefits  ; state benefits
account revenues:presents-received  ; money received as presents
account revenues:refunds:employer-a:expense-claims  ; employer A reimbursements of professional expenses (notes de frais), not perks
account revenues:wages:employer-a:bank-wire  ; employer A net salary, paid by bank wire
account revenues:wages:employer-a:meal-vouchers  ; employer A meal voucher top-ups (Swile)
account revenues:wages:employer-a:perks  ; employer A perks (e.g., public transport pass, phone plan)

; ==== Expenses
account expenses  ; type:X, expense categories
account expenses:discretionary:appliances-electronics  ; electronics and household appliances
account expenses:discretionary:bar-coffee  ; bars and coffee shops
account expenses:discretionary:books  ; books and magazines
account expenses:discretionary:clothes  ; clothes, shoes, dry cleaning
account expenses:discretionary:cosmetics  ; hygiene, hairdresser, personal care
account expenses:discretionary:exhibitions-museum-cinema  ; exhibitions, museums, cinema
account expenses:discretionary:hotel  ; hotels
account expenses:discretionary:leasure  ; other leisure and holidays
account expenses:discretionary:other  ; other shopping, stationery
account expenses:discretionary:presents-given  ; presents and donations given
account expenses:discretionary:digital-services  ; digital services, subscriptions (e.g., Spotify) and pay-as-you-go (e.g., AWS); phone and internet are in telcoms
account expenses:essential:bank-charges  ; bank fees
account expenses:essential:electricity  ; electricity, water, gas
account expenses:essential:food:fast-food  ; fast food
account expenses:essential:food:groceries  ; supermarkets
account expenses:essential:food:other  ; bakeries, small food shops
account expenses:essential:food:restaurant  ; restaurants
account expenses:essential:home-maintenance-supplies  ; home maintenance, furniture, supplies
account expenses:essential:medical  ; doctors, pharmacy, net of health insurance refunds
account expenses:essential:other  ; post, administrative and other essential costs
account expenses:essential:investment-bank-b-fees  ; bank B investment account brokerage fees and their refunds on the checking account
account expenses:essential:rent  ; rent
account expenses:essential:school-tuition  ; tuition and education
account expenses:essential:sport  ; sport and equipment
account expenses:essential:taxes  ; income tax and other taxes (cash basis)
account expenses:essential:telcoms  ; internet and phone
account expenses:essential:transport:bike  ; bike
account expenses:essential:transport:car-insurance  ; car insurance
account expenses:essential:transport:fuel  ; fuel
account expenses:essential:transport:maintenance  ; vehicle maintenance
account expenses:essential:transport:other  ; other transport
account expenses:essential:transport:public-transport  ; public transport
account expenses:essential:transport:toll-parking  ; tolls and parking
account expenses:essential:transport:train-plane-ferry  ; trains, planes, ferries
account expenses:essential:transport:vehicule-rent  ; car and motorbike rental

; ==== Commodities
; Use an amount format that's easily compatible w/ Python & R
commodity 1000.00 EUR
commodity 1000.000000 BTC
commodity 1000. "CW8"
commodity 1000.00 USDC
commodity 1000. DCAM
